  "body": "<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at 1.8.0 -->\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n### ✨ New Features\r\n* Shows client names in the query query log by @lissy93 in https://github.com/lissy93/AdGuardian-Term/pull/67\r\n### 🦋 Bug Fixes\r\n* Fixes axis in history chart by @lissy93 in https://github.com/lissy93/AdGuardian-Term/pull/68\r\n### 📕 Documentation\r\n* Docs and troubleshooting for GL.iNet plus small Docker update by @lissy93 in https://github.com/lissy93/AdGuardian-Term/pull/64\r\n### 🛠️ Build, CI and Refactors\r\n* Adds PR template, release labels, and labeler action by @lissy93 in https://github.com/lissy93/AdGuardian-Term/pull/66\r\n### 📦 Dependencies\r\n* Ref/update deps by @lissy93 in https://github.com/lissy93/AdGuardian-Term/pull/65\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/lissy93/AdGuardian-Term/compare/1.7.0...1.8.0",
